          }
        },
        "valueAttributePresent": false,
        "valueAttribute": null,
        "textContent": "\n\t\t\t<b>Verstohlenheit</b>, <b>Gottesschild</b>\n\t\t\t<b>Stealth</b>\n<b>Divine Shield</b>\n\t\t\t<b>Sigilo</b>\n<b>Escudo divino</b>\n\t\t\t<b>Sigilo</b>\n<b>Escudo divino</b>\n\t\t\t<b>Camouflage</b>\n<b>Bouclier divin</b>\n\t\t\t[x]<b>Furtività</b>.\n<b>Scudo Divino</b>.\n\t\t\t<b>隠れ身</b>\n<b>聖なる盾</b>\n\t\t\t<b>은신</b>\n<b>천상의 보호막</b>\n\t\t\t<b>Ukrycie</b>\n<b>Boska tarcza</b>\n\t\t\t<b>Furtividade</b>\n<b>Escudo Divino</b>\n\t\t\t<b>Маскировка</b>\n<b>Божественный щит</b>\n\t\t\t<b>ซ่อนตัว</b>\n<b>โล่ศักดิ์สิทธิ์</b>\n\t\t\t<b>潜行</b>\n<b>圣盾</b>\n\t\t\t<b>潛行</b>\n<b>聖盾術</b>\n\t\t"
      }
